From cf8f4e570dc1a3ceb07236753829fae765ca6123 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: srinidhira0 <srinidhi.rao@broadcom.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Jun 2025 09:03:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] jitterentropy-kcapi: Support-for-sample-collection

  -  Add support for jitterentropy sample collection
     which will be enabled under ACVP build.
     This patch enables functions which can capture 300 million
     raw data samples & 1000 restart samples.
     one raw data sample consists of a u64 value of high resolution
     time delta between two successive jent measurements.
     Modify sample write functions to only collect lower bound
     raw values i.e. raw data with no conditioning from jitterentropy.

Signed-off-by: srinidhira0 <srinidhi.rao@broadcom.com>
---
 jitterentropy-kcapi.c | 290 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 jitterentropy.c       |  65 +++++++++-
 jitterentropy.h       |   6 +
 3 files changed, 358 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

